---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const updated = "2026-10-04";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="[PLACEHOLDER: SEO title] Privacy Policy"
  description="How End to End Solutions handles data on this site: Google Analytics traffic measurement, cookies, and contact form submissions."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl flex-1 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
      Last updated: <time datetime={updated}>{updated}</time>
    </p>

    <!--
      [PLACEHOLDER: este texto es un borrador técnico. Debe revisarlo una
      persona cualificada y ajustarse a la jurisdicción del titular (p. ej.
      GDPR/LOPD) antes de publicar.]
    -->

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Summary</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site is operated by End to End Solutions. It is a small
          marketing site with no accounts, no payments and no advertising
          network. We only collect what we need to answer you and to know which
          pages are useful.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Traffic measurement</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We use <strong class="text-ink">Google Analytics 4 (GA4)</strong> to
          measure how visitors use the site — which pages are read, where they
          come from and roughly where they are located.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          GA4 is loaded only after you accept analytics cookies through the
          consent banner. If you reject, or dismiss the banner without
          accepting, no analytics script is requested and no measurement
          cookies are written.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Your choice is stored in your browser's local storage
          (<code class="font-mono text-sm text-ink">e2e_analytics_consent</code>)
          so we do not ask you again on this device. To change it later, clear
          that entry in your browser's site data for this domain.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Contact form</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          If you submit the contact form we keep the name, email address and
          message you provide so that we can reply. This information is used
          only to answer your enquiry and is not sold or shared for marketing.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          <!-- [PLACEHOLDER: definir el plazo de conservación y el canal de envío
               cuando exista el backend real del formulario.] -->
          [PLACEHOLDER: retention period and delivery channel pending]
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access,
          correct or delete the data we hold about you, and to object to or
          restrict its processing. Requests can be sent to the contact address
          below and will be answered within a reasonable time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Third parties</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Google Analytics is operated by Google LLC. Loading it transfers
          your IP address and usage data to Google, which processes it under its
          own privacy terms. No other third-party services are embedded on this
          site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          <!-- [PLACEHOLDER: dirección de contacto definitiva] -->
          Questions about this policy:
          <a
            href="mailto:hello@example.com"
            class="font-medium text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent-ink"
          >
            hello@example.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>